534
00:21:53.395 --> 00:21:55.731
{\an8}"Meet me at my usual lounge bar."

535
00:21:55.814 --> 00:21:57.399
{\an8}Sino ang nagsabing hindi tayo maaaring maging magkaibigan?

536
00:21:57.482 --> 00:22:01.236
